[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:00.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:04.68]left a single note and went on their way
[00:10.12]I never got their name until the credits
[00:14.82]now it plays here every single day
[00:20.00]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:22.64]One note at a time
[00:24.66]from people passing through
[00:30.18]a name beside a line
[00:32.94]and part of it is you
[00:39.18]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
